# Client-only comparison pages: serve the app shell with a 200 so arbitrary lens
# pairs load without a 404. The target must be `/`, not `/index.html`: Cloudflare's
# parser rejects any `/*` rule whose target ends in `/index` or `/index.html`
# ("Infinite loop detected ... has been ignored") because Pages redirects those
# paths back to the directory, and the dropped rule left compare URLs serving
# 404.html with a 404 status until 2026-09-16. `/` is never rewritten by Pages and
# never matches `/compare/*`, so this rule cannot loop.
/compare/* / 200
